{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ojOoTJwE721795494580.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>股評人李澤銘認為，內地流動性緊張情況還未解決，因此港股反彈幅度有限，不排除在23,000點之前已開始遇到阻力。</p><p></p><p>Blue Water Capital首席投資官李澤銘指出：「某程度上已反映本輪反彈，所以反彈100多、200點上去，已算是交到功課，包括加息因素，包括宏觀經濟疲弱因素，這些因素仍存在，內地流動性緊張情況還沒解決，均不利港股進一步反彈，港股整體指數上反彈幅度較受限，上方可能到23,000點有較大阻力。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T05:44:11.104712+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T04:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T18:37:34.417646+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T05:37:20.497778+00:00","content_hash":"4e3c4d60a667c7a39272a825acc603c805d08d7f8052cfb82b63d7e5e04e1069","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T05:44:11.104712+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}